  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/application-business-taxonomy/PaymentOptions>
    skos:definition "Payment options refer to the various methods by which a payer can settle a financial obligation to a payee. This encompasses a range of choices, including automated recurring payments (autopay), structured payment plans with defined terms (payment contract), formal commitments to make a future payment (promise to pay), and facilitated payment processes involving a third party (assisted payment)"@en;
